      "text": [
        "298 - وَقَالَ اَلصَّادِقُ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ: «إِذَا قَالَ لَكَ أَخُوكَ وَ قَدْ خَرَجْتَ مِنَ اَلْحَمَّامِ طَابَ حَمَّامُكَ فَقُلْ أَنْعَمَ اَللَّهُ بَالَكَ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.298 - Imam Jafar ibn Muhammad Al-Sadiq (as) said:\n\"If your brother says to you after you come out of the bath, 'May your bath be pleasant,' then reply with, 'May Allah (swt) grant you well-being.'\""
        ]
      }
